From 6f8c658604744d7f01b36015e42e519a2d4107cd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 04:10:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Preserve remote notice custody through completed
 resume receipts

Remote notice owners released exact events after a resumed automation completed when the initial keyed transcript row was absent. Synthetic resume events correctly strip control metadata, so transcript-only reconciliation lost durable custody despite canonical successful settlement.

Accept exact event keys from canonical automation admissions joined to persisted completed results, binding request, principal, owner and display category. Share proof with owner and collector dedup; never infer delivery from failure, missing results or arbitrary message metadata.

Proof: real ingress five-card batch with checkpoint, replacement epoch, compaction and owner restart; failure/interruption/unpersisted/missing controls and distinct later events. Consumer suite: 44 files / 636 passing. Receipt guards: 15 targeted mutants killed (producer guard strengthened after initial survivor). Full origin/main lint initially found unrelated stale-base BLE001; own diff lint passed. No live production mutation or initial-row omission cause claimed.
